we define the middle-market, see &#147;Business &#151; Investment Selection.&#148; </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">While our investment strategy will focus primarily on
middle-market companies in the United States, including senior secured loans, we also may invest up to 30% of our portfolio in investments of <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">non-qualifying</FONT> portfolio companies. Specifically, as part of this
