<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">The incentive fee consists of two parts: (i)&nbsp;an incentive fee on income and (ii)&nbsp;an incentive fee on capital gains. Each part of the
