origination activities and receive attendant arrangement, structuring or similar fees. </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Our executive officers, certain of our directors
and certain other finance professionals of Blue Owl also serve as executives of the Adviser, Owl Rock Technology Advisors LLC (&#147;ORTA&#148;), Owl Rock Diversified Advisors LLC (&#147;ORDA&#148;) and Owl Rock Private Fund Advisors LLC
