<P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Additionally, we have entered into an Expense Support and Conditional Reimbursement Agreement (the &#147;Expense Support Agreement&#148;) with
