promptly by us (a &#147;Reimbursement Payment&#148;) for Expense Payments if the sum of the Company&#146;s net investment income for tax purposes, net capital gains and the amount of any dividends and other distributions paid to the Company on
account of its investments in portfolio companies exceeds the distributions the Company paid to shareholders, subject to four limitations. Specifically, the Company will not make Reimbursement Payments to our Adviser, unless: (i)&nbsp;the
