transferable, except where a transfer is restricted by federal and state securities laws or by contract. We do not intend to list our securities on any national securities exchange and we do not expect there to be a public market for our shares in
the foreseeable future. As a result, your ability to sell your shares will be limited. We will not charge for transfers of our shares except for necessary and reasonable </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
