<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Owl Rock Core Income Corp. (the &#147;Company&#148;, &#147;we&#148;, &#147;us&#148;, or &#147;our&#148;) is an externally managed, <FONT
