<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">On September&nbsp;30, 2020, the Adviser agreed to waive 100% of the base management fee for the quarter ended December&nbsp;31, 2020. Any
