measurement.</P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Transfers between levels, if any, are recognized at the beginning of the quarter in which the transfer
