<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><B><I>Structuring and Execution. </I></B>Approval of an investment requires the unanimous approval of the Investment Committee. Once the
