<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Mr.&nbsp;D&#146;Alelio&nbsp;was formerly a Managing Director and CIO for Fixed Income at Putnam Investments, Boston, where he served from 1989
