Alternative Investments practice of PricewaterhouseCoopers LLP where he specialized in financial reporting, fair valuation of illiquid investments and structured products, internal controls and other technical accounting matters pertaining to
alternative investment advisors, hedge funds, business development companies and private equity funds. Mr.&nbsp;Swatt received a B.S. in Accounting from the University of Maryland and is a licensed Certified Public Accountant in New York. </P>
