<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P ALIGN="left" STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt">No incentive fee on income will be payable in any calendar quarter in which the
<FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">pre-incentive</FONT> fee net investment income does not exceed a quarterly return to investors of 1.25% of the Company&#146;s net asset value for that calendar quarter. We refer to this as the quarterly preferred
return. </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
