<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><I>The following description is based on relevant portions of the Maryland General Corporation Law (the &#147;MGCL&#148;) and on our charter
