<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Each Class&nbsp;S share issued in the offering, excluding shares issued pursuant to our distribution reinvestment plan, is subject to an
