reallowed (paid) to, participating broker-dealers. </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Pursuant to a distribution plan adopted by us in compliance with Rules <FONT
