<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">The Upfront Sales Load is not payable in respect of any Class&nbsp;S shares sold pursuant to our distribution reinvestment plan. </P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Consistent with the exemptive relief allowing us to offer multiple classes of shares, at the end of the month in which the Dealer Manager in
