generally available for purchase in this offering only (1)&nbsp;through <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">fee-based</FONT> programs, also known as wrap accounts, that provide access to Class&nbsp;I shares, (2)&nbsp;by endowments, foundations, pension
