placement agent. If you are purchasing shares through a placement agent, you should request additional information from your salesperson or financial intermediary. </P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">We may reimburse certain offering expenses, which consist of costs incurred by the Adviser and its affiliates on our behalf for legal,
