<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">As of June&nbsp;30, 2021, the Company had receivables from affiliates of $0.7&nbsp;million primarily comprised of expense support due from the
