<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">The Administration Agreement also provides that the Company reimburses the Adviser for certain organization costs incurred prior to the
commencement of the Company&#146;s operations, and for certain offering costs. </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">The Company reimburses the Adviser for services performed
