voting securities of the Company (as defined in the 1940 Act), or by the vote of a majority of the Board or by the Adviser. </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">No person who
