dealer manager, and certain participating broker-dealers solicit capital, for the Company&#146;s public offering of shares of Class&nbsp;S, Class&nbsp;D, and Class&nbsp;I common stock. Blue Owl Securities will be entitled to receive upfront selling
commissions of up to 3.50% of the offering price of each Class&nbsp;S share sold in this offering. Blue Owl Securities will be entitled to receive upfront selling commissions of up to 1.50% of the offering price of each Class&nbsp;D share sold in
