<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">On September&nbsp;30, 2020, the Adviser purchased 100 shares of the Company&#146;s Class&nbsp;I common stock at $10.00 per share, which
represents the initial public offering price. The Adviser will not tender these shares for repurchase as long as Owl Rock Capital Advisors LLC remains the investment adviser of Owl Rock Core Income Corp. There is no current intention for Owl Rock
Capital Advisors LLC to discontinue its role. On October&nbsp;15, 2020, the Company received a subscription agreement, totaling $25.0&nbsp;million for the purchase of Class&nbsp;I common shares of its common stock from Owl Rock Feeder FIC ORCIC
